        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "step4",
        "instruction": {
          "title": "4. Launch velocity splits into independent motions",
          "description": "Move to the projectile motion zone and inspect the launch ramp. The projectile's initial velocity has horizontal and vertical components, but gravity changes only the vertical component, so the two motions are independent."
        },
